%% StoryLab Voice — ask a question with no network (offline path)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student
    participant UI as Browser UI (chatbot.js)
    participant TS as TutorSession
    participant LIB as Curated topic library
    participant IDB as IndexedDB (storylab_v1)
    participant TTS as Web Speech (TTS)

    S->>UI: presses MIC (or TYPE)
    Note over UI: service worker served the app shell from cache
    UI->>TS: ask(transcript)
    TS->>TS: POST /api/tutor fails (network error)
    TS->>TS: badge switches to OFFLINE
    TS->>LIB: match transcript against 22 topics
    alt topic matched
        LIB-->>TS: curated answer
        TS-->>UI: answer (English / Hindi / Marathi variant)
    else no match
        TS-->>UI: "I could not reach the tutor. Try one of these questions."
        TS-->>UI: show starter chips
    end
    UI->>TTS: speak(answer)
    TTS-->>S: audio
    TS->>IDB: queue event (question, module, timestamp)
    Note over IDB: flushed by SyncService when the network returns
